## Renewing a login

# Shown on a Claude Code account's card while Notchling asks Claude Code to renew the login that ran out. It takes up to half a minute.
accounts-renewing = Renewing login…

# Shown on a Claude Code account's card when Claude Code ran and could not renew its login. The ⋯ is the button at the right of the card that opens its menu.
accounts-renew-failed = { -brand-claude-code } couldn't renew this login. Sign in again from ⋯.
